oad. Word travels about that, too.","A sharp-eyed peddler waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Tarek heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Nina heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Kidlat heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Nadia heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Esther heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Nora waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to The Red Table with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","◈ THE TABLE IS SET. A ring of pale light waits — take your seat from Haven when you are ready. Nothing is final until you sit."],"deferred":false,"sounded":false,"stoodDown":false,"deferDay":null,"soundDay":null,"soundTick":null,"stoodDownDay":null,"firstCheck":{"kind":"refusal","day":81,"snapIdx":0,"links":[{"villageId":"village_1","name":"Stonebridge","trust":100,"opinion":24,"arrears":0,"quota":6,"already":0,"snapFree":0,"generatedHere":true,"freeAdults":5,"wouldRefuse":false,"contribution":5,"naiveContribution":5,"faces":["Yuki Larsen","Victor Kowalski","June Nakamura","Tomás Haddad","Kira Hassan"]},{"villageId":"village_2","name":"Thornfield","trust":95,"opinion":28,"arrears":0,"quota":6,"already":0,"snapFree":9,"generatedHere":false,"freeAdults":9,"wouldRefuse":false,"contribution":6,"naiveContribution":6,"faces":["Aisha Santos","Rosa Diallo","Deshawn Lund","Peter Weber","Talia Park","Lena Zhang"]},{"villageId":"village_spl_31_87281","name":"The Bloodied","trust":100,"opinion":6,"arrears":0,"quota":2,"already":0,"snapFree":0,"generatedHere":true,"freeAdults":4,"wouldRefuse":false,"contribution":2,"naiveContribution":2,"faces":["Sanne Lund","Zoe Cohen"]}],"all