Who put YOU in charge?\"","Sanne heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👁 It waits for YOU to come close — the stillness is the trap. Spot the shape before you're in reach, and strike first. It only gets one.","Tashi heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","(Evolution awaits — choose one. Your power becomes something new.)","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Esteban heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","(Evolution awaits — choose one. Your power becomes something new.)","A cart-driver with flour on their sleeves waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A cart-driver with flour on their sleeves waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Jesse waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to Thornfield with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","Maya waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","🛖 Raised bins, sealed lids, clay and cool dark. The granary stands full of food that waits — smoked, dried, rendered, patient. Whatever comes, Haven eats a while longer.","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Each trial takes a FULL day-part and leaves you drained (−250 kcal). Pick one. The System waits — it has already run the simulations, and it is terrible at keeping secrets.","📓 Codex: First link formed with Emberhold. The gesture goes out now; the Dawn waits for seasons.","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","(Evolution awaits — choose one. Your power becomes something new.)","Maya waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","Maya waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud eno