rst. Everything else waits.\"","Benoit waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Liam heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","🛖 Raised bins, sealed lids, clay and cool dark. The granary stands full of food that waits — smoked, dried, rendered, patient. Whatever comes, Haven eats a while longer.","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Hattie heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Kavya heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Gus heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Each trial takes a FULL day-part and leaves you drained (−250 kcal). Pick one. The System waits — it has already run the simulations, and it is terrible at keeping secrets.","👥 Fiona heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Benoit waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","📓 Codex: First link formed with Emberhold. The gesture goes out now; the Dawn waits for seasons.","A weathered trader waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","👥 Francisco heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","🔥 The fire settles. Hannah has been quiet all evening, and now everyone knows why. \"Tick — I put it down today.\" \"It waits. The questing legs wave — the tell.\" \"Adjacent = attached. No dodge. It's ON you.\" A beat of silence, then the questions come all at once. Catalina asks \"We've been walking past those.\" Kavya asks \"Did it look at you? Before?\" Someone at the edge of the light says what everyone's thinking: \"So — what are we calling it?\"","Tariq waits two