{"seed":97207,"ar":{"seed":97207,"anchorCommit":"561f9701e383","mode":"baseline","post":{"mode":"baseline","sounded":false,"day":null,"soundTick":null,"preSoundReadiness":null,"deferral":null,"stoodDownDay":null,"stoodDownReason":null,"readyButAbsentDays":[],"linkCountBefore":null,"linkCountAfter":null,"actualAllies":null,"perVillage":null,"respondersVerified":null,"responderProblems":[],"commitReturns":[],"havenAfter":null,"havenVids":null,"readyAfter":null,"interceptorErrors":[],"checkTrajectory":[],"tickChecks":[],"projectionSkipped":0,"projectionSkipReasons":[]},"transcript":["A woman, maybe 30s, with a slouched posture heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A man, maybe 60s heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A man, maybe 40s, with a broad frame heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Thabo heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Elijah heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A man, maybe 30s heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Connor heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👁 It waits for YOU to come close — the stillness is the trap. Spot the shape before you're in reach, and strike first. It only gets one.","🎁 \"We watched your first week! You're good at... let us see...\" (A gift awaits — choose an ability.)","🎁 \"OH! You can hold more now! We've been HOLDING this — take it, take it, take it!\" (The System's gift awaits — choose an ability.)","Cameron heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👁 It waits for YOU to come close — the stillness is the trap. Spot the shape before you're in reach, and strike first. It only gets one.","Catalina waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","A cart-driver with flour on their sleeves waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Yuki heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Brian heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Catalina heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Cameron heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","(Evolution awaits — choose one. Your power becomes something new.)","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Catalina waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","A sharp-eyed peddler waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Each trial takes a FULL day-part and leaves you drained (−250 kcal). Pick one. The System waits — it has already run the simulations, and it is terrible at keeping secrets.","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Catalina waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Maya waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to Emberhold with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","📓 Codex: First link formed with Emberhold. The gesture goes out now; the Dawn waits for seasons.","Dmitri waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to Thornfield with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","🛖 Raised bins, sealed lids, clay and cool dark. The granary stands full of food that waits — smoked, dried, rendered, patient. Whatever comes, Haven eats a while longer.","A sharp-eyed peddler waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Catalina waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","🔥 The fire settles. Caleb has been quiet all evening, and now everyone knows why. \"Tick — I put it down today.\" \"It waits. The questing legs wave — the tell.\" \"Adjacent = attached. No dodge. It's ON you.\" A beat of silence, then the questions come all at once. Nasreen asks \"The fire feels smaller now.\" Siobhan mutters \"And you're still standing.\" Someone at the edge of the light says what everyone's thinking: \"So — what are we calling it?\"","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A cart-driver with flour on their sleeves waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A weathered trader waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Catalina waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","Lucia waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to The Hungry Road II with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A weathered trader waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A weathered trader waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Catalina waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","Tariq waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to The Hungry Road with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","A cart-driver with flour on their sleeves waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Catalina waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","Sanne waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to The Red Table with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Tariq waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to The Hungry Road with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Catalina leans in, voice low. \"Here's what we figured out about Nightlight. Never wade in. The glow is a mouth — it waits for you to come close. Never wade in. Strike the light from two squares out and it's just a fish with a lamp.\"","💡 COUNTER LEARNED — Nightlight: Never wade in. The glow is a mouth — it waits for you to come close. Never wade in. Strike the light from two squares out and it's just a fish with a lamp. (Someone at the haven knew the trick.)","📓 Codex: Counter: Never wade in — The glow is a mouth — it waits for you to come close. Never wade in. Strike the light from two squares out and it's just a fish with a lamp.","Lucia waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to The Hungry Road II with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Catalina waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A sharp-eyed peddler waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A weathered trader waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A cart-driver with flour on their sleeves waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Marcus waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to Ashford with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","Catalina waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A sharp-eyed peddler waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Lucia waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to The Hungry Road II with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","💡 COUNTER LEARNED — Spool: Feed it nothing. It records your strikes and plays them back. Give it waits and heals while it records and the replay is silence. (Elijah lived to tell it, twice — the village pieced it together.)","📓 Codex: Counter: Feed